{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "4e08a6957e06b387784a97196fcfd613d8022ed4d3049f10fdc3f119469aaa21", "ja": "おっと、そこの兄ちゃんのダンナ。\n今、ちょっとお時間いただけませんかねぇ？", "zh": "稍等一下，这位大哥哥客官。\n能不能占用你一点时间啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d51263c82824df4e48841f43fa39775dd7a8dcd45e8aaf229545c73fdf549ea8", "ja": "ん？　どうした、真美。\nそれはどういうキャラなんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么啦？真美？\n现在是演哪出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "8a499aecca03780a2d3dcea2b422f40676a585209ec9b679fcf9ae31ed14a922", "ja": "んっふっふ～、呼ばれてなくてもじゃじゃじゃじゃん！\n美少女探偵真美の登場だよー！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～虽然没人呼叫，但还是锵锵锵！\n美少女侦探真美登场啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "aef77fb8109725e3daae7482a73e17b78814fb232593764315f4641b48188c42", "ja": "さあ、ネタはカリッとサクッとあがってるんですぜ！\nユー、全部はいちまいなYO！", "zh": "好啦，事件已经罪证确凿啦！\nYou，一五一十招来吧YO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "910a653994327165006e61b954b125cd6fb978a80fba04eabf5bd3ab7e58c7ef", "ja": "まだキャラが定まってないみたいだが……まあいい。\nところで、ネタって何のことだ？", "zh": "看来你的角色个性还有点飘移……算了。\n对了，你说什么事件？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "a1f6348aad7a051008722f9f6fa9aa57904fcadd8afdb746364b4af575466608", "ja": "もちろん、真美の作ったプラモのことだよ～！\nいつの間にか行方不明なの！　ソーサク中なの！", "zh": "当然是真美做的模型啊～！\n一个没注意就失踪了！正在搜索中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "2b3e5683fc7f99facad51effa406124a2958ce5270d15a4c61d5b80684bbea3f", "ja": "見あたらなくなって、真美はピンと来たんだ。\n……犯人は、だいたい兄ちゃんだって！", "zh": "但是因为一直找不到，所以真美灵光乍现。\n……犯人通常都是大哥哥吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "72d62fcd981f64bd0ef56d4731e12059eb5f8d0582399657e38cb8dea3a11a1f", "ja": "な、なんて理不尽な……。\nそもそも真美、遊んだあと、ちゃんと後片付けしたか？", "zh": "这、这也太不讲理了吧……\n况且，真美，会不会是你自己玩完没有收好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "5519f5f9d45728789d75739a09f42b3177ffd7dd0ef3f7e8e3e8d2f97e50c423", "ja": "したっぽいよ？", "zh": "应该有收好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4862ae67d20d2fabe31e1fb177117f145b9437959cf8c81b2ce54d191e82955d", "ja": "絶対してないだろう。……そういえば、さっき青羽さん\nがプラモの箱を事務室に運んでたような……？", "zh": "你肯定没收……这么一说，刚才我好像看到\n青羽小姐把装模型的箱子搬到事务室……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "a1a689275cb3788d13e5170367ccd57ae66afca721c02de381218f23faf94c8a", "ja": "なんですとー！？\nつまり、この『プラモ行方不明事件』の犯人は……！", "zh": "你说什么！？\n这么说，这次『模型失踪事件』的犯人就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7d1e669d94595d4711f6503d3855d2b929fb52459afb76bcf14dd597ffac9ada", "ja": "そう……、後片付けをさぼった真美だな！\n青羽さんは、整頓してくれただけだ！", "zh": "没错……就是没收拾玩具的真美！\n青羽小姐只是帮你整理罢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "77df3c8853b8663623d57da19b3623aa9831412501b6ecd391fc7e8926c4bef4", "ja": "ガーン！　そ、そっか～！\nまさか真美が犯人とは、真美もびっくりんこだよ！", "zh": "什么！原、原来是这样～！\n没想到真美才是真正的犯人，连真美都大吃一惊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "d4f9c7027edd3b75ae6a1429094bc313d920e2e8658a37e9984eb928dc179621", "ja": "ありがと、兄ちゃん♪\n真美、しんみょーにお縄をちょうだいしてくんね？", "zh": "谢啦，大哥哥♪\n真美这就去乖乖就逮喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0053_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "34241c31c527b173a8a847fcd8bad83a538a7db9c432c8c0e85e7fad8eec6396", "ja": "みさきち～！\n一緒にプラモであっそぼ～♪", "zh": "美咲咲～！\n一起玩模型吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
